<section>

<div class="card">

<h2>
How This Journal Works
</h2>

<p>
Entries follow the engineering roadmap in curriculum order, from the
foundational Python projects through the enterprise AI platforms.

Each completed product receives a dedicated entry covering its design
decisions, architecture, implementation process and trade-offs.

At the end of each engineering module, a retrospective consolidates
the patterns, tools and lessons shared across its products.

Flagship milestones receive longer deep-dives exploring the broader
architectural context.
</p>

</div>

</section>

